WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:06.660
So as many of you know, we have a shortage
of what is called PPE right now, personal

00:00:06.660 --> 00:00:08.500
protective equipment.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:14.959
This includes things like masks and gloves,
face shields, goggles, other equipment that

00:00:14.959 --> 00:00:21.099
health care professionals need to safely treat
people with Corona virus without themselves

00:00:21.099 --> 00:00:25.689
being at risk of the disease and to try to
minimize the possibility of spreading it to

00:00:25.689 --> 00:00:27.220
other people.

00:00:27.220 --> 00:00:33.210
For weeks now, Donald Trump has been very
transparently blaming the previous administration.

00:00:33.210 --> 00:00:36.579
That's code for Barack Obama for the shortage.

00:00:36.579 --> 00:00:40.570
It's been panic at the state level for hospitals
trying to get more people.

00:00:40.570 --> 00:00:48.160
Right now, even most of the Corona virus tests
require the administrator to wear PPE.

00:00:48.160 --> 00:00:49.629
Hopefully that will change soon.

00:00:49.629 --> 00:00:55.140
We're seeing some new rapid self swab tests
come to market, as Trump says, including one

00:00:55.140 --> 00:00:59.329
from Abbott, which will start to be available
maybe as early as this week if they're telling

00:00:59.329 --> 00:01:00.329
the truth.

00:01:00.329 --> 00:01:04.880
But we're really short on PPE because it's
required for tests and for many other reasons.

00:01:04.880 --> 00:01:09.570
Friends of mine who are I have two friends
who are E.R. doctors here in Boston work for

00:01:09.570 --> 00:01:17.140
different hospital administrators and both
were told they will have one mask to use all

00:01:17.140 --> 00:01:18.140
day.

00:01:18.140 --> 00:01:21.890
Normally you would be normal, you'd have a
face shield and you change the mask between

00:01:21.890 --> 00:01:24.220
patients and put the face shield over it.

00:01:24.220 --> 00:01:27.150
They will have one mask for the entire day.

00:01:27.150 --> 00:01:34.520
Well, it has now been revealed that Donald
Trump sent a ton of PPE to China, nearly 18

00:01:34.520 --> 00:01:40.480
tons of supplies in February, but is now blaming
the previous administration for the shortage.

00:01:40.480 --> 00:01:41.480
Check it out.

00:01:41.480 --> 00:01:45.980
Here's from talking about the old system inherited
from Barack Obama.

00:01:45.980 --> 00:01:47.290
I.

00:01:47.290 --> 00:01:55.700
This administration inherited an obsolete,
broken old system that wasn't meant for this.

00:01:55.700 --> 00:01:57.390
We discarded that system.

00:01:57.390 --> 00:02:04.630
And we now have a new system that can do millions
of people as you need them.

00:02:04.630 --> 00:02:08.720
But we had to get rid of a broken old system
that didn't work.

00:02:08.720 --> 00:02:12.290
It worked only in a very limited basis.

00:02:12.290 --> 00:02:14.290
And we're very proud of what we've done.

00:02:14.290 --> 00:02:16.330
It's incredible what we've done.

00:02:16.330 --> 00:02:19.610
And this system will now serve for the future
for future problems.

00:02:19.610 --> 00:02:23.330
Hopefully you don't have a problem like this,
but something will come up.

00:02:23.330 --> 00:02:29.530
We have now a great system and it's almost
fully in gear, but it's able to test millions

00:02:29.530 --> 00:02:30.640
of people.

00:02:30.640 --> 00:02:38.129
But we inherited a broken old and frankly,
a terrible system.

00:02:38.129 --> 00:02:43.879
We fixed it and we've done a great job and
we haven't been given the credit that we deserve

00:02:43.879 --> 00:02:44.989
that, I can tell you.

00:02:44.989 --> 00:02:50.510
Well, it turns out that a lot of what we are
now experiencing is Trump's own doing.

00:02:50.510 --> 00:02:57.629
So aside from, you know, we're in year four
of Trump's presidency, Obama gave Trump the

00:02:57.629 --> 00:02:59.709
pandemic response playbook.

00:02:59.709 --> 00:03:06.730
The State Department admitted back on February
7th that they facilitated the transportation

00:03:06.730 --> 00:03:15.810
of 18 tons of medical supplies to Chinese
people, including masks, gowns, gauze, respirators

00:03:15.810 --> 00:03:18.420
and other vital materials.

00:03:18.420 --> 00:03:24.530
Secretary of State Mike Pompeo tweeted a video
of a plane being unloaded that was filled

00:03:24.530 --> 00:03:26.829
with our stuff back on February 7th.

00:03:26.829 --> 00:03:28.529
We gave them the stuff.

00:03:28.529 --> 00:03:33.230
We sent them the masks, gowns and all of the
stuff we are now short on, which Trump is

00:03:33.230 --> 00:03:36.019
making states compete over.

00:03:36.019 --> 00:03:41.590
So it's actually an even more deranged situation
than we believed, which was already, by the

00:03:41.590 --> 00:03:43.330
way, very, very deranged.

00:03:43.330 --> 00:03:48.519
Trump didn't take the threat seriously here,
called it the Chinese virus blames China.

00:03:48.519 --> 00:03:50.329
Now, we have no masks.

00:03:50.329 --> 00:03:55.279
We're short on all of the stuff that Trump
is failing to secure for our state governors.

00:03:55.279 --> 00:03:58.739
And now we find out he sent a whole bunch
of it to China.

00:03:58.739 --> 00:04:05.390
These last six or now closer to eight weeks
have been the biggest failure of the Trump

00:04:05.390 --> 00:04:06.390
presidency.

00:04:06.390 --> 00:04:08.980
And we may end up I hope not.

00:04:08.980 --> 00:04:14.310
We may end up with a death toll that is not
just 10 times higher, but maybe 50 times higher

00:04:14.310 --> 00:04:19.390
than it needed to be because of failure after
embarrassing failure by Donald Trump.

00:04:19.390 --> 00:04:22.470
Now, let me say something else, because I
know we're going to have a bunch of people

00:04:22.470 --> 00:04:24.590
jump in and attack me over this.

00:04:24.590 --> 00:04:26.680
I want to be really clear.

00:04:26.680 --> 00:04:32.200
This is not me doing some hyper nationalist
argument about Trump should only worry about

00:04:32.200 --> 00:04:34.260
Americans and not Chinese people.

00:04:34.260 --> 00:04:35.330
That's not the issue here.

00:04:35.330 --> 00:04:37.070
The issues here are multiple.

00:04:37.070 --> 00:04:42.350
First, the fact that Trump has and continues
to blame the previous administration for things

00:04:42.350 --> 00:04:45.490
that were his own decisions that caused the
problems.

00:04:45.490 --> 00:04:46.490
That's tragic.

00:04:46.490 --> 00:04:47.770
It's disgusting.

00:04:47.770 --> 00:04:51.270
And it I fear that it is working actually
with a lot of his followers saying this was

00:04:51.270 --> 00:04:52.860
actually Obama's fault.

00:04:52.860 --> 00:04:58.830
Number two, the fact that Trump was sending
this stuff to China on February 7th, but only

00:04:58.830 --> 00:05:05.960
in early March did he start taking seriously
the procuring of masks and PPE for our hospitals

00:05:05.960 --> 00:05:12.260
tells us that for a full month, from early
February to early March, Trump knew we were

00:05:12.260 --> 00:05:17.200
low in the stockpile because he sent a bunch
of the stockpile to China.

00:05:17.200 --> 00:05:22.410
But he didn't do a damn thing about starting
to replace it for our hospitals until March.

00:05:22.410 --> 00:05:26.040
So, again, the criticism is not how dare we
help China.

00:05:26.040 --> 00:05:27.720
That's not the critique.

00:05:27.720 --> 00:05:31.480
The critique is clearly this is not Obama's
fault.

00:05:31.480 --> 00:05:37.460
But more importantly, Trump had a signal on
February 7th or earlier at minimum that we

00:05:37.460 --> 00:05:39.390
need to replenish our.

00:05:39.390 --> 00:05:42.800
Own supply of masks and other PPE.

00:05:42.800 --> 00:05:44.210
And he didn't do it.

00:05:44.210 --> 00:05:50.590
And now it's become a scramble that continues
to be a scramble as we are now days from entering

00:05:50.590 --> 00:05:51.750
April.

00:05:51.750 --> 00:05:54.000
It's incompetence at every turn.

00:05:54.000 --> 00:05:56.350
It's not about we should never help China.

00:05:56.350 --> 00:05:59.400
It's about don't blame Obama for your mistake.

00:05:59.400 --> 00:06:04.180
And also don't act like nobody could have
foreseen this when you knew you depleted your

00:06:04.180 --> 00:06:06.810
own stockpile on February 7th.

00:06:06.810 --> 00:06:11.200
And then we've got press conferences still
happening, unlike March 25th, where he's saying

00:06:11.200 --> 00:06:13.020
we're trying to get masks.

00:06:13.020 --> 00:06:15.470
We're trying to get this stuff disgusting.

